AuronQ Universal Miner v0.4.5-alpha release trigger

Broad general-purpose hardware update:
- validated NVIDIA CUDA -> vendor-neutral OpenCL GPU -> CPU AUTO chain
- OpenCL GPU backend for AMD / Intel / NVIDIA on accelerated Windows/Linux packages
- canonical byte-for-byte AQM64 self-test required for every accelerator
- wider CUDA architecture generation from the release toolkit
- conservative generic OpenCL thermal-auto duty when no trusted cross-vendor sensor exists
- no dedicated specialized-mining-appliance integration
- no Mainnet consensus changes
